{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"01","section_name":"Brand Identity Guidelines","id":"BIG-01","title":"Logo Construction Grid — Sacred Geometry of CCC","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":32,"cfg":8.0,"logo_mode":"CCC + AKO coexist — guidelines document exception only","skin_tone_unity":"N/A — no people","micrographics":"Precise crimson construction lines showing baseline, cap height, x-height, letter-spacing measurements; crop marks at corners; dimension arrows; registration marks","microtext":"Space Mono numerals annotating measurements; AKO STUDIOS secondary lockup below CCC; STUDIOS tracked wide; clear-zone annotation CLEAR SPACE = 1C WIDTH","camera":"Shot from directly above; flat overhead; even diffused light; no perspective distortion; clinical orthographic view","lighting":{"source":"Diffused overhead — even, shadowless","direction":"Even 360°","color":"Neutral white 5500K","quality":"Flat, shadowless, document-style"},"color_palette":{"background":"#F0EBE2 warm cream linen","primary_mark":"#0A0A0A void black","construction_lines":"Crimson red","paper":"Off-white printed stock"},"short_editorial_note":"The sacred geometry document. CCC at maximum authority. Construction lines as brand discipline.","cinematic_description":"A brand identity guidelines page photographed flat on warm cream linen. Visible 8px cross-hatch textile weave beneath paper. CCC in massive Playfair Display 900, surrounded by precise crimson construction lines. Paper has slight corner curl. A Staedtler pencil rests diagonally bottom-right casting soft shadow.","environment_atmosphere":{"setting":"Flat linen surface, overhead studio","time_of_day":"N/A — studio","weather":"N/A","background":"Warm cream linen #F0EBE2 with 8px cross-hatch weave","depth":"No depth — flat document photograph"},"subject_detail":"The CCC logotype as primary subject. Secondary: AKO wordmark. Supporti