ero — black, cream, red construction lines only"},"design_layout_dna":{"format":"Brand guideline document photograph","structure":"Centered construction grid with clear zones","negative_space":"Generous — document breathes"},"technical_fidelity":{"resolution":"1920×1080","steps":32,"cfg":8.0,"format":"16:9 landscape"},"film_emulation":{"stock":"Slight Kodak Ektachrome document quality","grain":"5% — barely perceptible","halftone":"4% like printed proof"},"prompt":"A pristine brand identity guideline page shot flat on warm cream linen (#F0EBE2) with visible 8px cross-hatch textile weave beneath the paper. The page displays the CCC logotype in massive Playfair Display 900 heavy serif, pure black on white stock, surrounded by precise crimson red construction lines showing baseline, cap height, x-height, and letter-spacing measurements annotated in tiny Space Mono numerals. Below, a secondary lockup shows AKO in condensed Bebas Neue with STUDIOS tracked wide beneath. Clear-zone boundaries marked with hairline rules and dimension arrows. Paper has a slight curl at one corner. A single black Staedtler pencil rests diagonally across the bottom-right corner casting a soft shadow. Shot from directly above, even diffused lighting. Film grain overlay 5%. Xerox edge bloom on brightest whites. Halftone dots 4% like a printed proof.","negative_prompt":"Digital screen, glossy surface, color gradients, people, garments, busy backgrounds, decorative elements, sticker clutter, clean digital HDR, glossy corporate","style_refs":"Helmut Lang identity system by Peter Saville + NASA 1975 Graphics Standards Manual + Maison Margiela white label documentation"}

{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"01","section_name":"Brand Identity Guidelines","id":"BIG-02","title":"Color System Swatches — The Void Palette","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":30,"cfg":7.8,"logo_mode":"AKO only","skin_tone_unity":"N/A","micrographics":"Six paper swatches with hand-cut fiber edges; small ACCENT BLEED isolated swatch right; faint 12×7 chaos-grid ghost watermark at 5% opacity; VHS tracking line lower 20%","microtext":"Space Mono micro text under each swatch listing HEX and CMYK values; ACCENT BLEED label; AKO wordmark micro caption","camera":"Harsh directional light upper-left; matte black surface; slight angle — not fully overhead; slight glancing light to show swatch paper edges","lighting":{"source":"Single directional — upper left","direction":"45° from upper left","color":"Cool neutral 5600K","quality":"Harsh, directional — creating swatch shadows"},"color_palette":{"background":"Matte black surface #0A0A0A","swatches":["#0A0A0A","#1A1A1A","#333333","#F5F2EC","#F0EBE2","#FFFFFF"],"accent":"#1A0A0A"},"short_editorial_note":"Six swatches. No decoration. The palette is the system.","cinematic_description":"Brand color system on matte black. Six hand-cut paper swatches in single horizontal row. Space Mono HEX/CMYK values beneath each. Isolated ACCENT BLEED swatch right. Chaos-grid ghost watermark 5% behind.","environment_atmosphere":{"setting":"Matte black surface","lighting":"Harsh directional upper-left","grain":"7%","vhs":"One VHS tracking line faint across lower 20%"},"subject_detail":"Six paper swatches as primary subjects. Paper has hand-cut fiber edges — not die-cut.","core_composition":{"angle":"Slight angle — not full overhead","framing":"Landscape document","visual_hierarchy":"Swatches dominant → HEX labels → ACCENT swatch accent","balance":"Horizontal row, even spacing"},"cultural_authenticity":"Josef Müller-Brockmann Int