tional light from upper-left. Grain 7%. One VHS tracking line faint across the lower 20%.","negative_prompt":"Rainbow colors, glossy plastic, rounded corners, digital UI mockups, decorative patterns, florals, clean digital HDR","style_refs":"Josef Müller-Brockmann International Typographic Style + Raf Simons archive color documentation + A.P.C. brand manual"}

{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"01","section_name":"Brand Identity Guidelines","id":"BIG-03","title":"Typography Specimen — Three Voices of AKO","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":32,"cfg":8.2,"logo_mode":"AKO only","skin_tone_unity":"N/A","micrographics":"Registration marks visible in margins; horizontal crease across middle third; printed zone hairline rules 0.5pt; two black binder clips at top edge","microtext":"Bottom zone: Space Mono coordinates, timestamps, collection numbers as metadata block","camera":"Slight angle — not full overhead; concrete surface beneath; single directional source; slight cast shadows","lighting":{"source":"Single directional from upper right","direction":"Creating deep shadow on concrete beneath","color":"Neutral warm 5200K","quality":"Hard, directional — highlights top of paper, shadow below"},"color_palette":{"background":"Raw concrete surface","paper":"Heavyweight uncoated cream stock","ink":"#0A0A0A"},"short_editorial_note":"Three type zones. Three voices. The alphabet as brand DNA.","cinematic_description":"Large-format typography specimen sheet on raw concrete, shot at slight angle. Three zones separated by 0.5pt hairlines: TOP — Bebas Neue A–Z at massive scale. MIDDLE — Playfair italic 'Embrace the chaos.' BOTTOM — Space Mono metadata block. Horizontal crease across middle third. Two binder clips at top.","environment_atmosphere":{"surface":"Raw concrete — aggregate stones visible","lighting":"Hard directional from upper right","grain":"Heavy 10% — Kodak Tri-X pushed"},"subject_detail":"Typography specimen sheet as primary subject. Three distinct zones of type. Paper crease as human artifact.","core_composition":{"angle":"Slight angle — not fully flat","framing":"Landscape — sheet fills frame","zones":["TOP: Bebas Neue alphabet","MIDDLE: Playfair italic phrase","BOTTOM: Space Mono metadata"]},"cultural_authentic