vy serif italic: 'Embrace the chaos.' in elegant black. BOTTOM — Space Mono block of coordinates, timestamps, and collection numbers as metadata. The sheet has a horizontal crease across the middle third catching light. Printed registration marks visible in margins. Two black binder clips hold the top edge. Single directional source light creating deep shadows on the concrete beneath. Grain overlay heavy at 10%, mimicking Kodak Tri-X pushed.","negative_prompt":"Digital display, colorful backgrounds, people, products, soft lighting, multiple fonts, clean white studio, clean digital HDR","style_refs":"Emigre magazine specimen sheets + Helvetica documentary close-ups + Wolfgang Weingart experimental typography photography"}

{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"01","section_name":"Brand Identity Guidelines","id":"BIG-04","title":"Clear Space Rules — The Silence Around the Mark","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":28,"cfg":7.6,"logo_mode":"AKO only (clear space demonstration)","skin_tone_unity":"N/A","micrographics":"Dotted boundary line around lockup; measurement arrows annotated in Space Mono; four DO NOT examples with red X overlays; Kubrick corridor proportions of void","microtext":"CLEAR SPACE = 1C WIDTH annotation; thin measurement arrows; DO NOT use examples labeled","camera":"Flat center; Kubrick-corridor perspective implied by proportional void space","lighting":{"source":"Even, flat — black void absorbs all","quality":"Zero — the void has no light, the mark has clarity"},"color_palette":{"background":"#0A0A0A pure void black","mark":"#FFFFFF white","annotation":"Red for DO NOT examples","measurement":"Thin white lines"},"short_editorial_note":"The silence surrounding the mark. The void is not empty — it protects.","cinematic_description":"Pure black background. AKO / STUDIOS / CCC centered lockup. Dotted clear-space boundary. Measurement arrows in Space Mono. Four smaller DO NOT examples below with red X marks.","environment_atmosphere":{"background":"Pure void black — #0A0A0A","atmosphere":"Kubrick-corridor weight","grain":"4% only"},"subject_detail":"Logo lockup as primary subject. Clear-space boundary as structural element. DO NOT examples as cautionary footnotes.","core_composition":{"angle":"Flat center","framing":"Centered lockup with surrounding void","hierarchy":"Lockup dominant → boundary → DO NOT examples"},"cultural_authenticity":"NASA Identity Standards Manual. Supreme brand discipline. Apple Human Interface Guidelines silence.","mood":"Authority through restraint. The silence protects the mark.","texture_material_behavior":{"background":"Pure digital void