{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"01","section_name":"Brand Identity Guidelines","id":"BIG-05","title":"Texture Library — Woven Chaos Grid Pattern","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":34,"cfg":8.3,"logo_mode":"AKO only","skin_tone_unity":"N/A","micrographics":"2×2 grid of square swatches; crop marks at corners; Space Mono captions under each swatch with pattern name and file reference; shot flat on warm plywood","microtext":"Pattern name + file reference under each swatch in Space Mono","camera":"Flat overhead on warm plywood; even diffused light; slight warmth from wood surface","lighting":{"source":"Even overhead diffused","color":"Warm 4800K — plywood warmth","quality":"Flat, even — document style"},"color_palette":{"background":"Warm plywood — blonde wood grain","swatches":["#0A0A0A chaos grid","#F0EBE2 cream weave","Kodak grain macro","#000 with origin dot"]},"short_editorial_note":"Four textures. The brand's material vocabulary.","cinematic_description":"Brand texture library page. Four square swatches 2×2 on cream stock placed on warm plywood. TOP-LEFT: chaos grid. TOP-RIGHT: cross-hatch cream weave. BOTTOM-LEFT: grain macro. BOTTOM-RIGHT: void with origin dot.","environment_atmosphere":{"surface":"Warm blonde plywood","grain":"6%"},"subject_detail":"Four texture swatches: chaos grid, cream weave, grain macro, void dot.","core_composition":{"grid":"2×2 equal squares","spacing":"Even margins between swatches"},"cultural_authenticity":"Maison Margiela material library. A-COLD-WALL* texture research. Samuel Ross design process.","mood":"Material intelligence. The textures are not decoration — they are the language.","texture_material_behavior":{"swatch_1":"12×7 chaos grid — varying near-black cells","swatch_2":"8px cross-hatch woven cream-ivory","swatch_3":"400% macro grain — silver halide crystals visible","swatch_4":"Pure black with 4px white origin dot at center"},"composition_dna":{"2x2_grid":"Equal weight to all four textures","plywood":"Warm, organic counter to digital-adjacent textures"},"visual_hierarchy":["Four swatches equally weighted","Crop marks framing the document","Space Mono captions below each"],"photorealistic_rendering":{"swatch_detail":"Each texture rendered at macro scale — individual grain/thread visible","plywood":"Blonde wood grain visible in exposed margins"},"editorial_elements":{"caption":"Texture Library / Four Surfaces / SS25","serial":"BIG-05"},"branding_integration":{"logo_mode":"AKO only — micro caption"},"typography_standards":{"labels":"Space Mono — pattern name + file ref"},"color_grading_profile":{"tone":"Warm — plywood warmth bleeds into paper","grain":"6%"},"design_layout_dna":{"format":"Material library swatch sheet","grid":"2×2"},"technical_fidelity":{"resolution":"1920×1080","steps":34,"cfg":8.3},"film_emulation":{"grain":"6%","warmth":"Fuji Pro 400H slight warm push"},"prompt":"Brand guidelines texture page showing four square swatches in a 2×2 grid on warm cream stock. TOP-LEFT: the 12×7 chaos grid — rectangular cells in varying near-black shades from #0A0A0A to #222, digital noise texture. TOP-RIGHT: cross-hatch woven cream-ivory fabric texture, embroidery heritage. BOTTOM-LEFT: heavy film grain texture at 400% macro magnification showing individual silver halide crystals. BOTTOM-RIGHT: solid black field with a single 4px white origin dot at center. Space Mono captions under each with pattern name and file reference. Crop marks at corners. Shot flat on warm plywood surface. Grain overlay 6%.","negative_prompt":"Colorful patterns, floral designs, people, products, digital screens, gradients, busy composition, clean digital HDR","style_refs":"Maison Margiela material library + A-COLD-WALL* texture research boards + Samuel Ross design process"}

{"brand":"AKO Studios","collection":"CCC — Controlled Chaos Collection SS25","version":"Visual Prompt Bible v2.0","section_id":"02","section_name":"Mission Statement Images","id":"MS-01","title":"We Were Born in the Noise — LA Concrete Channel","aspect_ratio":"16:9","width":1920,"height":1080,"steps":35,"cfg":8.4,"logo_mode":"CCC embroidery only — discovered on garments","skin_tone_unity":"Seven models: Black man 23 (platinum buzzcut); Japanese woman 22 (cherry red bob); Latino skater 21 (cobalt blue hair); White woman 25 (shaved head); South Asian man 24 (long dark hair); Mixed-race woman 22 (natural afro); Korean man 23 (green hair). Ages 19–27 range. Tones: deep brown, medium-warm, medium-olive, light warm, medium-olive deep, medium-warm, light-medium. All carry tattoos.","micrographics":"Space Mono footer micro text: AKO STUDIOS / EST. MMXXIV; halftone dots 5%; VHS tracking line lower quarter","microtext":"AKO STUDIOS / EST. MMXXIV in Space Mono footer; WE WERE BORN IN THE NOISE in semi-transparent Bebas Neue upper frame 55% opacity","camera":{"lens":"24mm wide-angle — slight barrel distortion","position":"Ground level","angle":"Low dutch angle — subject elevation","height":"Approximately 18 inches off ground"},"lighting":{"source":"Harsh golden hour — late afternoon LA sun","direction":"Diagonal from left — cutting shadows across concrete floor","color":"Warm golden amber 3800K","quality":"Hard, directional — volumetric where concrete dust catches light"},"color_palette":{"channel":"Cool concrete grey","light":"Warm golden amber","shadows":"Deep cool blue-grey","garments":"Black and cream","sky":"Pale overcast"},"short_editorial_note":"Seven people. One concrete channel. The world as their runway and their battlefield.","cinematic_description":"Documentary-style group in an enormous LA storm drain channel at golden hour. Seven models clustered at center. Channel stretches to vanishing point. WE WERE BORN IN THE NOISE overlaid at 55% opacity. Ground-level wide a